 line-height:1.6;">
            It is the connection and integration of multiple international companies, markets, technologies, assets, business systems and operating structures. The identities of the participating entities, transaction details and sequence of integration will remain confidential until the official disclosure.
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">The idea was born in Budapest in 1990, when the world, the market and available technology were not yet ready for its full implementation. Following decades of development, the project enters its public and operational phase on 7 October 2026.</p>

